[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://dkebusbolt2026"]

; Kebus' staff bolt -- the little green orb his ranged attack lobs at the player.
; Was drawn procedurally in scripts/enemies/projectile.gd (the visual=null fallback);
; extracted here so it lives with the other attack VFX and is editable in-engine.
; A CPUParticles2D ember trail (local_coords=false, so it streaks behind the shot as
; it flies) plus a soft glow Core sprite. Set as Kebus' ranged_particle in
; configs/level_config.gd; projectile.gd instances it as the shot's `visual`.

